nsh pull request #530 (https://github.com/longbridge/nsh/pull/530), upstream commit
4482d09f0181e4021ab93762840bbd297ac20676 in https://github.com/longbridge/nsh, unchanged:
android: Fix wss:// WebSockets, which had no TLS crypto provider (#530)
It changes nsh-core's WebSocket client, which iOS uses too.

